  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哎～爷爷～\n我的独剑鞘它无精打采的。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n就算给它回复也还是状态很差。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54CEFF5E72377237FF5E000A6211768472EC525197985B8365E07CBE625391C77684300200100001BE00000A5C317B977ED95B8356DE590D4E5F8FD8662F72B660015F885DEE300200100002011401660000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "呵呵……那是因为\n它的剑刃有点变钝啦！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "547554752026202690A3662F56E04E3A000A5B83768452515203670970B953D8949D5566FF01001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那……\n我该怎么办才好呀？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A320262026000A62118BE5600E4E48529E624D597D5440FF1F00100002011401660000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "说到让刀剑宝可梦独剑鞘\n重新变锋利的方法……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF452308BA9520052515B9D53EF68A672EC52519798000A91CD65B053D8950B5229768465B96CD520262026001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那就是沙基拉斯！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A35C31662F6C9957FA62C965AFFF01001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "为什么啊！？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E3A4EC04E48554AFF01FF1F00100002011401660000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "只要让独剑鞘反复劈砍沙基拉斯\n那坚硬的身体，在这个过程中，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n它的剑刃就会重新变得锋利起来！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EA89818BA972EC5251979853CD590D5288780D6C9957FA62C965AF000A90A3575A786C76848EAB4F53FF0C57288FD94E2A8FC77A0B4E2DFF0C00100001BE00000A5B837684525152035C314F1A91CD65B053D85F97950B52298D776765FF01001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "真的吗？可就算突然和我说\n需要沙基拉斯，我也……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "771F76845417FF1F53EF5C317B977A817136548C62118BF4000A970089816C9957FA62C965AFFF0C62114E5F2026202600100002011401660000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哎！我问你啊！\n你捉到沙基拉斯了没呀？<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n和我的独剑鞘来对战吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54CEFF01621195EE4F60554AFF01000A4F60634952306C9957FA62C965AF4E866CA15440FF1F00100001BE00000A548C6211768472EC5251979867655BF962185427FF0100100002011401660000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "只带沙基拉斯1只同行宝可梦\n来和我的独剑鞘对战吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EA5E266C9957FA62C965AF003153EA540C884C5B9D53EF68A6000A6765548C6211768472EC525197985BF962185427FF0100100002011401660000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "只要让独剑鞘反复劈砍沙基拉斯\n那坚硬的身体，在这个过程中，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n它的剑刃就会重新变得锋利起来！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EA89818BA972EC5251979853CD590D5288780D6C9957FA62C965AF000A90A3575A786C76848EAB4F53FF0C57288FD94E2A8FC77A0B4E2DFF0C00100001BE00000A5B837684525152035C314F1A91CD65B053D85F97950B52298D776765FF01001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你这不是带着沙基拉斯嘛！\n你愿意和我的独剑鞘对战吗？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F608FD94E0D662F5E2677406C9957FA62C965AF561BFF01000A4F60613F610F548C6211768472EC525197985BF962185417FF1F00100002011401660000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "来对战吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67655BF962185427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "还是算了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD8662F7B974E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好吧……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D54272026202600100002011401660000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "太好啦！\n那我们就快来对战吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1096,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "592A597D5566FF01000A90A362114EEC5C315FEB67655BF962185427FF0100100002011401660000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我们打输了啊，独剑鞘。\n等我马上就给你回复哦。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114EEC62538F934E86554AFF0C72EC525197983002000A7B4962119A6C4E0A5C317ED94F6056DE590D54E6300200100002011401660000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "锵！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9535FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嗯？独剑鞘找回状态了？\n好厉害啊，爷爷！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55EFFF1F72EC52519798627E56DE72B660014E86FF1F000A597D53895BB3554AFF0C72377237FF0100100002011401660000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哈～哈～哈！\n我就说嘛。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54C8FF5E54C8FF5E54C8FF01000A62115C318BF4561B3002001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "沙基拉斯是很重要的！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6C9957FA62C965AF662F5F8891CD89817684FF01001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "当然，这对于\n沙基拉斯来说也是件好事。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F537136FF0C8FD95BF94E8E000A6C9957FA62C965AF67658BF44E5F662F4EF6597D4E8B3002001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "因为只要它确认过身体的硬度\n就可以安心进化了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56E04E3A53EA89815B83786E8BA48FC78EAB4F537684786C5EA6000A5C3153EF4EE55B895FC38FDB53164E86FF01001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "虽然听起来像是乱编的……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "867D7136542C8D77676550CF662F4E717F1676842026202600100002011401660000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不过独剑鞘也找回状态了，\n所以还是要感谢沙基拉斯啊！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D8FC772EC525197984E5F627E56DE72B660014E86FF0C000A62404EE58FD8662F8981611F8C226C9957FA62C965AF554AFF0100100002011401660000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "还有你，谢谢你\n帮我的独剑鞘恢复活力！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD867094F60FF0C8C228C224F60000A5E2E6211768472EC525197986062590D6D3B529BFF0100100002011401660000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "宝可梦之间有让人意想不到的\n互助关系也不足为奇呀！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
